{"timestamp":"2026-10-04T14:42:43.413Z","ordinal":12523,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_06b7a884f26959d3016ac265d750bc87d09ce6b71747d72ee6","status":"completed","call_id":"call_qKCxPj8Q3BVZdkB1HjfVm0K5","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nimport json\\nx=json.loads(Path('tmp/docs-cloudflare/local-workerd-receipt.json').read_text())\\nprint(json.dumps({'candidate':x['candidate'],'screenshots':x['screenshots'],'runtime':x['runtime']},indent=2))\\np=Path('docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md')\\np.write_text(p.read_text()+'''\\\\n\\\\n### Native built Worker proof — implementation in progress, 2026-10-05\\\\n\\\\nThis branch starts from locally qualified draft #124 revision\\\\n`b2a556c8818a83fdfe97d79709bbda0d89b4b8db`. Its exact hosted Quality run\\\\n`37209125848` passed; that parent result does not qualify this later worktree.\\\\nThe built-proof entry remains at its existing path, with native Command parsing,\\\\na closed named service and owning receipt/screenshot Schemas. Private native\\\\nfilesystem, Crypto, Config, child-process streams, HTTP, monotonic time and\\\\nscoped browser work replace the previous orchestration. Provider credentials\\\\nremain outside the filtered child/browser environment. The receipt is saved\\\\nonly after scoped process/browser cleanup. Full compiler ownership now includes\\\\nthis command and its private adapters.\\\\n\\\\nInitial real local workerd/Chromium checks pass the existing sixteen outcome\\\\nchecks, nine concurrent requests, one shared context, three server functions,\\\\nzero document reloads/diagnostics, reduced motion, pending/404/recoverable states\\\\nand accessibility. A run without temporary phase logging also saves both\\\\nscreenshots. Native directory and combined input hashes exactly match the prior\\\\nscript. An earlier browser failure remains unexplained; a temporary logging\\\\nremoval syntax error is separately corrected and retained. These observations\\\\ndo not establish whole-repository qualification. Native failure/interruption/\\\\noutput-bound fixtures, canonical strict enforcement/source controls and final\\\\nrepository qualification remain pending before this slice is accepted.\\\\n\\\\nDocumentation impact: **Change required** for private script/service/Schema/\\\\ncompiler/test and enforcement owners, app README, testing architecture, this\\\\nplan, T002 ledger and dated receipt. **Preserve** command paths, local-only\\\\nWrangler arguments, installed manifests, digest bytes, all existing observable\\\\nchecks, screenshot/output identities, public content, dependency selections,\\\\ncanonical skills/digests, provider state and tax results. **N/A** Changeset\\\\n(private unversioned app), generated content, new provider operation and public\\\\ncontract. No merge/deployment/publication/provider apply/version application.\\\\nDEV-73 remains in progress; DEV-74–81 follow accepted dependencies.\\\\n''')\\nPY\",max_output_tokens:3500}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rg -n 'cloudflare-built|test-cloudflare-built' oxlint.config.ts\",max_output_tokens:2000}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"sed -n '20,70p' tools/oxlint/portable-rules.test.ts\",max_output_tokens:3500}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1055e-488d-75e2-ab79-097882eda37b","create_time":1791124942.859347}}}
