r at\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:420:inventory proves hosted application behavior.\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:517:  Rule options are an exact Schema ingress in `taxkit-rules.ts`; the actual CLI\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:519:  scoped CLI operation accepts a configuration path for this invalid-config\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:522:- Eight collection-host CLI canaries test exact file, assignment target,\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:525:  mutations run the whole real CLI verifier and require its expected failure:\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:531:- Lexical gap CLI cases reject renamed native/weak constructors, Object/Reflect\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:593:  negative cases for encoding and `Schema.decodeTo`, and real Oxlint CLI\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:596:- The Oxlint CLI, repository-path, governance and skill-policy suites run through Bun-hosted Vitest with `@effect/vitest`.\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:601:  source fixtures are excluded from test discovery, not from real CLI coverage.\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:606:  egress admissions. The Fetch signature admission is tested through an exact admitted CLI fixture and a neighbouring canary,\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:663:  `oxlint-disable` comment tokens naming either boundary rule. Real Oxlint CLI\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:710:  not implement its validation policy inside `@taxkit/scripts`.\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:728:The Quality-workflow test owner uses Bun-hosted Effect Vitest, Effect FileSystem,\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:739:change the hosted workflow or establish publication/deployment.\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:742:Documentation policy and runbook suites also use Bun-hosted Effect Vitest and\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:749:files have separate exact canonical runtime admissions. A