{"timestamp":"2026-10-04T15:07:03.239Z","ordinal":13097,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a1055e-488d-75e2-ab79-097882eda37b","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-3c1cce9a-800a-4523-81d6-921af89aa8b9","process_id":"41636","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","sed -n '1,15p' docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md; sed -n '1,13p' docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md; sed -n '1,15p' docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json; tail -6 /private/tmp/taxkit-local-toolchain/built-native-full-verification.log"],"cwd":"file:///Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"sed -n '1,15p' docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md; sed -n '1,13p' docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md; sed -n '1,15p' docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json; tail -6 /private/tmp/taxkit-local-toolchain/built-native-full-verification.log"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"---\ndocument_type: architecture\nlifecycle: current\nauthority: canonical\nowner: taxkit-quality-owner\nlast_reviewed: 2026-10-05\nreview_trigger: verification graph, proof boundary, CI, deployment, or test-owner change\n---\n\n# Testing and quality\n\nTaxKit quality depends on deterministic calculation tests, package boundary\ntests, graph validation, trace snapshots, API/SDK parity and build/type health.\n\n## Scope\n---\ndocument_type: execution-plan\nlifecycle: current\nauthority: supporting\nowner: taxkit-implementation-owner\nlast_reviewed: 2026-10-05\nreview_trigger: task progress, dependency qualification, acceptance evidence or authority change\n---\n\n# Clean slate foundation implementation\n\nCooper's 4 October request authorises implementation, reviewable commits and\ndraft PRs. It supersedes the old Q14 whole-design admission hold; Q1–Q13 remain\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://taxkit.local/schemas/product-spec-task-plan.v1.json\",\n  \"spec\": \"docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md\",\n  \"title\": \"Clean slate TaxKit foundation \\u2014 implementation slices\",\n  \"status\": \"in_progress\",\n  \"last_reviewed\": \"2026-10-05\",\n  \"authority\": \"Cooper explicitly authorised implementation, reviewable commits and draft PRs on 2026-10-04. No merge, deploy or publication; provider-plan approval remains separate.\",\n  \"principles\": [\n    \"Retain tax rules/results and their proof while replacing application foundations.\",\n    \"Use immutable Schema-derived values and declarative, pipe-first Effect workflows across all owned apps/packages/tests/scripts/infrastructure; no local mutation, imperative loops or helper sprawl. Necessary state has a scoped React/Effect owner and pure updates.\",\n    \"One primary owner integrates and accepts whole slices; agent or test counts do not establish proof.\",\n    \"Every required owning document, README, rule, export, generated source, skill and runbook changes within the affected slice.\",\n    \"Use current qualified exact dependencies; no silent downgrade, broad exception or unproved peer override.\",\n    \"Each task is pending until its actual postconditions and applicable checks pass. Proposed tasks do not authorise cloud changes.\"\n  ],\n\n//:test:quality-workflow:task: cache miss, executing 9a570d894ac6829f\n//:test:quality-workflow:task: $ bun --bun vitest run --config tools/vitest.config.ts tools/quality-workflow\n//:test:quality-workflow:task: \n//:test:quality-workflow:task:  RUN  v5.0.3 /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit\n//:test:quality-workflow:task: \n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"---\ndocument_type: architecture\nlifecycle: current\nauthority: canonical\nowner: taxkit-quality-owner\nlast_reviewed: 2026-10-05\nreview_trigger: verification graph, proof boundary, CI, deployment, or test-owner change\n---\n\n# Testing and quality\n\nTaxKit quality depends on deterministic calculation tests, package boundary\nt