t owners, app README, testing architecture, this\nplan, T002 ledger and the\n[dated receipt](../../documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-05-native-built-worker-proof.json).\n**Preserve** command aliases, local-only Wrangler arguments, installed manifests,\ndigest bytes, all existing observable checks, screenshot/output identities,\npublic content, dependency selections, canonical skills/digests, provider state\nand tax results. **N/A** Changeset (private unversioned app), generated/public\ncontent, new provider operation and release contract. No merge, deployment,\npublication, provider apply or version application.\n''';p.write_text(s)\nPY\nPATH=/private/tmp/taxkit-local-toolchain/bun-darwin-aarch64:$PATH bun run check:docs > /private/tmp/taxkit-local-toolchain/built-native-final-docs.log 2>&1\nPATH=/private/tmp/taxkit-local-toolchain/bun-darwin-aarch64:$PATH bun run check:runbooks > /private/tmp/taxkit-local-toolchain/built-native-final-runbooks.log 2>&1\nPATH=/private/tmp/taxkit-local-toolchain/bun-darwin-aarch64:$PATH bun run format:check > /private/tmp/taxkit-local-toolchain/built-native-final-format-check.log 2>&1\nPATH=/private/tmp/taxkit-local-toolchain/bun-darwin-aarch64:$PATH bun run changeset:status > /private/tmp/taxkit-local-toolchain/built-native-final-changeset-status.log 2>&1\ngit diff --check"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":990560625},"formatted_output":""},"started_at_ms":1791126731981,"completed_at_ms":1791126732972}}
